     4881         i-gl-Host-Code      = v-cntxt-host-code-obj
     4882         i-gl-Contract-Code  = buf_contract.contract-code
     4883         .
     4884   END.
     4885   FOR EACH
     4886       buf_contract-specif
     4887        NO-LOCK
